# One line ending everywhere: the tests, the shell scripts and the workflow fingerprints compare bytes, and a CRLF checkout on Windows
# breaks them (12 tests failed for exactly that reason). The repository already stores LF; this makes every checkout LF too.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
